const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文在政策选择模型指引下，利用国家选举和全球峰会前后的变化研究期权市场中的政治不确定性。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article analyzes political uncertainty in the option market, using variation around national elections and global summits guided by a policy-choice model. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12406",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它把期权价格与跨越政治事件的暴露相连并进行比较，事件定义、合约存续期和经济条件均是检验的一部分。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It links option prices to event-spanning exposure and compares political-event timing across settings, so event definition, contract life, and economic conditions are part of the test. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12406",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要期权报价和合约条款、标的价格、到期和事件时钟、选举或峰会日期、国家身份、波动率指标和市场质量过滤。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Required inputs include option quotes and contract terms, underlying prices, expiry and event clocks, election or summit dates, country identifiers, volatility measures, and market-quality filters. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12406",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要报告样本中跨政治事件期权价格更高，不提供普适套保指令或任何选举结果预测。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"Its abstract reports that political-event-spanning options are more expensive in the studied setting; it does not give a universal hedge instruction or a forecast of any election outcome. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12406",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"对齐期权和事件时区；保留行权价、期限、流动性和报价过滤；区分预定事件与新闻冲击；记录跨国匹配选择。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Align option and event time zones; preserve strike, maturity, liquidity, and quote filters; distinguish scheduled events from news shocks; record cross-country matching choices. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12406",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2016)。期权价格依赖模型和市场，历史政治事件证据不是政治建议、交易规则或尾部保护保证。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2016). Option prices are model- and market-dependent, and historical political-event evidence is not political advice, a trading rule, or a guarantee of tail protection. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12406",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2016) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Price of Political Uncertainty: Theory and Evidence from the Option Market”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。期权价格依赖模型和市场，历史政治事件证据不是政治建议、交易规则或尾部保护保证。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Price of Political Uncertainty: Theory and Evidence from the Option Market”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
